(* Beginning of Notebook Content *)
Notebook[{
Cell["Hypergraph Rewriting", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"5711936b-b3a8-da47-9938-7dbed371eca3"],

Cell["WolframInstitute`Hypergraphs` \[LongDash] rules, matches and events", \
"Subtitle",ExpressionUUID->"a3db0ca9-18bd-7f43-978b-7cb8a5f98a05"],

Cell["\<\
A rewrite rule is a pair of hypergraphs. Applying it to a hypergraph means \
finding the ways its input sits inside that hypergraph, and for each of them \
replacing what was matched by the output. This notebook is the tour of that: \
what a rule is, how matching works and what it depends on, and what an \
application gives back. Everything below is live output from src/.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"efcb7d68-9389-db40-acf1-8e285ae05153"],

Cell["\<\
What is not here yet is the machinery around rewriting \[LongDash] the \
generations of states a rule produces, the causal graph of its events, the \
conditions under which two events depend on one another. That is the next \
piece of work, and the events described in section 3 are the material it will \
be built out of.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2e63ef90-b075-4749-a80f-698bd7c45c96"],

Cell["Loading the package", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"64c382bd-516a-5441-b4be-400ea037e1db"],

Cell["\<\
The cell below is an initialization cell, which the front end evaluates when \
this notebook is opened. By the time you read this the package is already \
loaded.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2696bd80-ec7f-d94e-82ef-761ade446191"],

Cell["\<\
PacletDirectoryLoad[ParentDirectory[NotebookDirectory[]]];
Needs[\"WolframInstitute`Hypergraphs`\"]\
\>", "Input",
 InitializationCell->
  True,ExpressionUUID->"3ccf9f1f-3f8d-b847-9a46-9f7b41787bf1"],

Cell["1. A rule is a pair of hypergraphs", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"3a277bbe-1df7-b345-91f6-65a00e14507e"],

Cell["\<\
HypergraphRule takes an input and an output. Either may be written as \
anything Hypergraph accepts, so a rule can be given as plainly as a pair of \
edge lists:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3047586b-abfb-2c42-9c8d-5f21b97cac73"],

Cell["sub = HypergraphRule[{{1, 2}}, {{1, 3}, {3, 2}}]", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"f894e59c-6c95-e244-b330-2a32ea91fc3d"],

