Cell["2. Matching", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"71549885-d1b4-794f-9d44-84be79ad5bc2"],

Cell["\<\
Before anything is rewritten, the input has to be found. \
HypergraphRuleMatches gives the ways it sits inside a hypergraph, and nothing \
else:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ab14d7a1-9fae-b441-81f4-71ba3ca32559"],

